+# Sub-project 1: `jet_cad_2d_kit`, the contract's symbol side — Implementation Plan
+
+> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.
+
+**Goal:** Create `packages/jet_cad_2d_kit`: the components a plan stores, the `.jetlib` library format with its fifteen-rule validator, `KitNames`, `SymbolLibrarySource` and `PlanKit`, the pure-Dart authoring toolkit (catalog language, builder, shape helpers, geometry snapshot, conformance test), `docs/kits.md`, and the CI job with the kit dependency rule.
+
+**Architecture:** One new Flutter package with two public libraries. `package:jet_cad_2d_kit/jet_cad_2d_kit.dart` (the contract, Flutter) exports `lib/src/model/` and `lib/src/kit/`; `package:jet_cad_2d_kit/authoring.dart` (pure Dart) exports `lib/src/model/` and `lib/src/authoring/`. `lib/src/model/model.dart` is the single export list of the model, so both libraries carry the same model. The proven logic of `jet_cad_floor_plan/lib/src/symbols/` and `jet_cad_restaurant_symbols/lib/src/shapes.dart` is ported, never imported; the old packages are not touched.
+
+**Tech Stack:** Dart 3.13.5 / Flutter 3.47.6, pub workspaces (`resolution: workspace`), `jet_cad_2d` ^0.7.2 (`DraftDocument`, `DraftDocumentCodec`, `ComponentRegistry`, commands), `vector_math`, `meta`, `flutter_test`, `package:yaml` and `package:test` in `tool/ci`, GitHub Actions.
+
+**Spec:** [docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-13-kit-contract-design.md](../specs/2026-10-13-kit-contract-design.md) (sub-project 1, decisions K1–K9) and its umbrella [docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-13-kit-architecture-design.md](../specs/2026-10-13-kit-architecture-design.md) (A1–A16; where they disagree the umbrella wins). Both carry the 2d naming of `e75064e`. Read both before any task: every task cites its K-sections.
+
+**Execution:** subagent-driven (a fresh implementer and an independent reviewer per task, then a whole-branch review).
